om/v/t64.5771-25/491824741_1649392406474998_5410864248309636487_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yoYBkfWOOYkQ7kNvwFkMqg-&_nc_oc=Adr7o6MPBQYSxsYLYtNmUfrQh78SLXTLWiwcGgpMBUVXBnbxYaZgPCCcjhOuX6MhNss&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJQ2F2mwp_KoGzfDGLYmYLel4zy8aaNT3duH4s8YS3mPg&oe=6AA15FBC"}, {"file_name": "WhatsApp Image 2026-03-12 at 8.27.12 PM (1).png", "id": "1228045482776477", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1228045486109810_3434612178793438110_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AZgjX-v4Wt0Q7kNvwEhgmDu&_nc_oc=AdrPMFYqpg6ZrKEXS3DFCpg6Ws0gK1So8Z9ZZ_UpWn2zQeLYNvlRydE3LFYToUzdb8A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLUi6l0WLjhCl13oo4r7DZoYl1k5sP45XvXnsUsPRUSZg&oe=6AA1528E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Tejo Strike", "keywords": ["tejo", "game", "colombia", "boom", "good"], "long_description": "The Most Explosive Sport in the World Comes to VR!\n\nStep into the vibrant atmosphere of a traditional Colombian \"tejer\u00eda\" from the comfort of your home. Tejo Strike is the ultimate virtual reality simulation of Colombia\u2019s national sport. Combining physics-based precision, cultural authenticity, and the satisfying thrill of pyrotechnics, this game is built from the ground up to showcase the power of the Meta Quest 3S.\n\nWhat is Tejo?\nImagine a game that combines the skill of horseshoes with the excitement of professional fireworks. In Tejo, players throw a heavy metal disc (the tejo) across a long court filled with a clay box (el barro). In the center lies a metal ring (el boc\u00edn) lined with small gunpowder envelopes called mechas. Your goal? Hit the mecha and make it go BOOM.\n\nKey Features:\n\nRealistic Physics-Based Throwing: Feel the weight of the tejo in your hand. Our custom physics engine replicates the arc and impact of a real throw, requiring genuine skill and practice to hit the target consistently.\n\nImmersive Colombian Environments: Play in beautifully rendered environments that capture the soul of Colombia. From rustic countryside courts to lively urban tejer\u00edas, complete with traditional music and the cheers of the crowd.\n\nTactile Haptic Feedback: Every hit on the clay and every thunderous explosion is felt through your controllers, providing an immersive experience that tells you exactly how close you were to the mark.\n\nVisual Spectacle: Powered by URP (Universal Rend", "short_description": "Experience the explosive tradition of Colombia like never before! > Tejo Strike brings the high-stakes, gunpowder-fueled sport of Tejo into the palm of your hands in stunning VR. Step into the virtual court, grab your heavy metal tejo, and aim for the mechas to trigger spectacular explosions. Whether you are a master of precision or just looking for some loud, satisfying fun, Tejo Strike offers an authentic and addictive cultural experience. Aim, throw, and blow things up\u2014it\u2019s time to strike!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/317be51d-26f9-463e-ae51-ed8b95fb99d1", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "its_camilo", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://its-camilo.github.io/portfolio/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SING